{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44245908",
      "title": "Working with Asynchronous Form Actions",
      "sourceHash": "7c6bb2ba6ec9550f70e00ce39246e5ac044043af1d7a2a59b62d0a32692e7687",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 5.34,
          "en": "So now that we got our form action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.34,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "connected to the form with help of useActionState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 10.77,
          "en": "and we're handling errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.77,
          "end": 14.67,
          "en": "it's time to handle the success case, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.67,
          "end": 17.04,
          "en": "So it's time to submit the data to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 19.263,
          "en": "if valid data has been entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "Now in this starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 27.09,
          "en": "I already created a context object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.09,
          "end": 29.43,
          "en": "and provider for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.43,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "And here in this ContextProvider component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 35.31,
          "en": "I am managing some opinions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.31,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "opinions that are loaded from the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 42.24,
          "en": "But I also have a addOpinion function, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.24,
          "end": 45.84,
          "en": "where I send a request to the backend to store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.84,
          "end": 48.903,
          "en": "a NewOpinion, a post request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.95,
          "end": 53.1,
          "en": "A post request, that in the end will be sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.1,
          "end": 56.193,
          "en": "to this backend endpoint here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 60.96,
          "en": "As you can see, there is an artificial delay here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.96,
          "end": 62.07,
          "en": "in that backend code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 65.34,
          "en": "so that we can also simulate a slow backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.34,
          "end": 67.533,
          "en": "because that will become important later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.37,
          "end": 70.47,
          "en": "But for the moment, it doesn't matter too much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "I have this backend here and in there I have some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 76.293,
          "en": "that will store the submitted data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 80.25,
          "en": "So we have that addOpinion function in the context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.25,
          "end": 83.4,
          "en": "and this function is made available to any component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "that's interested through this context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 90.15299999999999,
          "en": "Here, addOpinion is added as a method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.11,
          "end": 94.97999999999999,
          "en": "So therefore in NewOpinion, in order to send that request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.97999999999999,
          "end": 98.163,
          "en": "we have to get hold of that for context here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "And we can do that in that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 105.03,
          "en": "with help of the useContext() hook of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.03,
          "end": 107.13,
          "en": "or since this is a project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.13,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "that uses at least React version 19,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 113.1,
          "en": "we can use just the use() hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 115.563,
          "en": "which has been added with React 19.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 119.75999999999999,
          "en": "This use() hook can also be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.75999999999999,
          "end": 124.62,
          "en": "after being imported from React to access some context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.62,
          "end": 127.32,
          "en": "In this case, my OpinionsContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.32,
          "end": 129.993,
          "en": "which also must be imported of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.31,
          "end": 134.49,
          "en": "So then I got this context value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.49,
          "end": 138.18,
          "en": "and here I'll use object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.18,
          "end": 141.42000000000002,
          "en": "to get hold of that addOpinion function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 143.943,
          "en": "that's provided through that context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 148.59,
          "en": "And it's that function that should now be called here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.59,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "in this form action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 154.5,
          "en": "So here, after checking for errors, if we have none,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.5,
          "end": 156.363,
          "en": "I'll call addOpinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 161.82,
          "en": "And to addOpinion, you should pass an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.82,
          "end": 163.82999999999998,
          "en": "that contains a title property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 167.07,
          "en": "a body property, and a username property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 172.05,
          "en": "And conveniently, these are the properties or the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 173.883,
          "en": "I'm getting from my form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.68,
          "end": 179.94299999999998,
          "en": "So we can simply pass this object here to addOpinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.74,
          "end": 185.13,
          "en": "Now, addOpinion, if you take a look at it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.13,
          "end": 188.1,
          "en": "in the context, in the OpinionsContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.1,
          "end": 190.83,
          "en": "addOpinion is an async function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.83,
          "end": 195.03,
          "en": "Because I'm using a wait here to wait for this Promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 198.963,
          "en": "that's returned by fetch to resolve to its response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.25,
          "end": 203.16,
          "en": "Therefore, what we might wanna do in our form action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.16,
          "end": 208.16,
          "en": "as well is also await here so that we only clear the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.51,
          "end": 214.5,
          "en": "after the data has been submitted to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.5,
          "end": 219.03,
          "en": "This will also become important later once we update the UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219.03,
          "end": 221.523,
          "en": "based on the current submission status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 222.36,
          "end": 226.44,
          "en": "So I wanna pause this form action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.44,
          "end": 229.77,
          "en": "I wanna wait for the result of calling a opinion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 229.77,
          "end": 233.88,
          "en": "before I mark this form action as completed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 233.88,
          "end": 237.84,
          "en": "by executing the last bit of code, because again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.84,
          "end": 240.033,
          "en": "that will become important later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 241.71,
          "end": 246.09,
          "en": "Now, in order to use await here, we of course have to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.09,
          "end": 250.89,
          "en": "add async in front of this function keyword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 250.89,
          "end": 255.3,
          "en": "And therefore this now becomes an async form action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 255.3,
          "end": 257.19,
          "en": "And the great thing is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 257.19,
          "end": 260.82,
          "en": "that this is something that's supported by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 260.82,
          "end": 264.48,
          "en": "Your form actions can be both synchronous",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 264.48,
          "end": 267.27,
          "en": "or asynchronous functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 267.27,
          "end": 270.54,
          "en": "Both works and React doesn't care too much,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 270.54,
          "end": 274.08,
          "en": "though if it is an asynchronous function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 274.08,
          "end": 276.858,
          "en": "React will actually wait for the Promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 276.858,
          "end": 281.55,
          "en": "that is returned by this action function to resolve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 281.55,
          "end": 286.55,
          "en": "before it internally marks this form as submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 287.79,
          "end": 290.493,
          "en": "And again, this will matter later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 291.75,
          "end": 294.72,
          "en": "For now, we can just save it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 294.72,
          "end": 297.94,
          "en": "And if you now go back and you enter your name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 298.92,
          "end": 303.64,
          "en": "and you add a title and your text, if you click submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 308.79,
          "end": 310.98,
          "en": "then you see after a short pause,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 310.98,
          "end": 313.92,
          "en": "the form is cleared and the UI is also updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 313.92,
          "end": 318.873,
          "en": "And my opinion is showing up here due to how this app works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 320.04,
          "end": 323.34,
          "en": "And if I reload, my opinion is still there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 323.34,
          "end": 326.523,
          "en": "because it really was stored on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 327.81,
          "end": 329.97,
          "en": "And it does show up here on the frontend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 329.97,
          "end": 331.32,
          "en": "after being submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 331.32,
          "end": 336.32,
          "en": "because in my context in addOpinion, once I got a response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 336.39,
          "end": 340.47,
          "en": "I actually update the opinions that are shown in this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 340.47,
          "end": 344.253,
          "en": "and add this newly added opinion at the front of this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 345.15,
          "end": 348,
          "en": "after I got back this response from the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 348,
          "end": 350.553,
          "en": "if it wasn't an error response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 351.63,
          "end": 354.27,
          "en": "So that's working the way it should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 354.27,
          "end": 356.64,
          "en": "and that's of course great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 356.64,
          "end": 360.78,
          "en": "but now it would be nice if when we submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 360.78,
          "end": 364.68,
          "en": "it wouldn't be stuck in this strange mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 364.68,
          "end": 366.39,
          "en": "where it isn't really clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 366.39,
          "end": 368.49,
          "en": "whether submitting worked or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 368.49,
          "end": 370.83,
          "en": "But if instead, we, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 370.83,
          "end": 373.65,
          "en": "would disable this submit button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 373.65,
          "end": 375.69,
          "en": "whilst the form is being submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 375.69,
          "end": 378.81,
          "en": "also to make sure that it's not being submitted twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 378.81,
          "end": 381.003,
          "en": "And that's therefore what we'll do next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}